## 4. Provider Abstraction Layer

### Architecture

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│            Provider Abstraction            │
│  ┌────────┐  ┌────────┐  ┌────────┐       │
│  │ OpenAI │  │ Gemini │  │ Ollama │  ...   │
│  │ Driver │  │ Driver │  │ Driver │       │
│  ├────────┤  ├────────┤  ├────────┤       │
│  │ Chat   │  │ Chat   │  │ Chat   │       │
│  │ Stream │  │ Stream │  │ Stream │       │
│  │ Embed  │  │ Embed  │  │ Embed  │       │
│  │ Vision │  │ Vision │  │ Vision │       │
│  │ Audio  │  │ Audio  │  │ Audio  │       │
│  └────────┘  └────────┘  └────────┘       │
└────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Provider Interface

```typescript
interface AIProvider {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  models: AIModel[];
  capabilities: Capability[];

  // Core
  complete(req: CompleteRequest): Promise<CompleteResponse>;
  stream(req: CompleteRequest): AsyncIterable<StreamChunk>;

  // Embeddings
  embed(text: string): Promise<number[]>;

  // Multimodal (optional)
  analyzeImage?(image: ImageInput, prompt: string): Promise<Analysis>;
  synthesizeSpeech?(text: string, voice: VoiceConfig): Promise<AudioBuffer>;
  transcribeSpeech?(audio: AudioInput): Promise<string>;

  // Configuration
  configure(config: ProviderConfig): void;
  health(): Promise<ProviderHealth>;
}
```

### Routing Strategy

- **Automatic**: Kernel routes based on capability + availability
- **Manual**: User/provider override per program
- **Fallback chain**: Primary → Secondary → Local (Ollama)

---

## 5. Memory Orchestration

### Architecture

Memory is a **three-tier system**:

```
Tier 1: Ephemeral (Session)
  └─ Active conversation context
  └─ Current program state
  └─ Window positions, UI state

Tier 2: Working (Local)  
  └─ Recent conversations (last N)
  └─ Program-specific knowledge
  └─ User preferences
  └─ SQLite (indexed + serialized)

Tier 3: Persistent (Knowledge FS)
  └─ All historical conversations
  └─ Saved research, code, documents
  └─ Vector embeddings for semantic search
  └─ PostgreSQL (future)
```

### Memory System Calls

```typescript
// Store structured memory
memory.store({
  key: "project/whyspace/architecture",
  value: { /* structured data */ },
  metadata: {
    program: "research-agent",
    timestamp: Date.now(),
    tags: ["architecture", "whyspace", "kernel"],
    embedding: vector // auto-generated
  }
});

// Semantic search
memory.search({
  query: "quantum routing patterns",
  limit: 5,
  threshold: 0.7,
  programs: ["research-agent", "code-studio"]
});

// Context injection
memory.context({
  program: "core-chat",
  maxTokens: 2000,
  recency: true,
  relevance: true
});
```

