## 6. Multimodal Runtime

### Input Pipeline

```
┌──────────┐    ┌──────────┐    ┌──────────────┐
│  Text    │───→│          │    │              │
│  Image   │───→│  Kernel  │───→│  AI Provider │
│  Audio   │───→│  Router  │    │  (best fit)  │
│  File    │───→│          │    │              │
│  Video   │───→│          │    │              │
└──────────┘    └──────────┘    └──────────────┘
                      │
                ┌─────┴──────┐
                │  Preprocessor           │
                │  OCR · ASR · Embed   │
                └────────────────┘
```

### Supported Modalities

| Modality | Input | Output | Provider Support |
|---|---|---|---|
| Text | ⌨️ Keyboard / Paste | Markdown / Code / JSON | All |
| Image | 📸 Upload / Paste | Analysis / Edit / Generation | Gemini, OpenAI |
| Audio | 🎤 Microphone / File | Transcription / Music | OpenAI, Gemini |
| Code | 📄 File / Editor | Execution / Debug / Refactor | Code Studio |
| File | 📎 Drag & Drop | Parse / Transform | Any text-based |

